/*
  CommandQuickActionsWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0030 · CommandQuickActionsWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `CommandQuickActionsWidget` resolves (table "CommandQuickActionsWidget") lives
  here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/CommandQuickActionsWidget.tsx — the `dashboard`
  namespace `widget.quickActions.*` keys). The registry group mirrors
  registry/commands.ts ("command-quick-actions"). The remaining keys back the
  native-only chrome (freshness / loading / error / dispatch feedback +
  accessibility), which the web source delegates to the shared WidgetShell + toast.
*/

